        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Live ops\nPrometheus scrapes the **persistent** app metrics server (`:8000/metrics`, always on). Evaluation scripts write metrics via multiprocess files; values appear here within ~15s. For question-level comparison after a run, open **Quality & Latency** or **By Question**. MLflow UI: http://localhost:5000 \u2192 **Experiments \u2192 gguf-demo**."
      }
